WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.466
Our heroes continue to Anistar City,

2
00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:07.966
where Ash hopes to get his seventh Kalos Gym Badge

3
00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:11.566
and ultimately enter the Kalos League.

4
00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:15.466
The next Pokémon Showcase will take place in Anistar City!

5
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.866
We'll be seeing all of you performers there.

6
00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:20.200
Wow. Anistar City...

7
00:00:20.266 --> 00:00:22.800
Awesome. That's where I'll get my next Gym Badge.

8
00:00:22.866 --> 00:00:26.700
Yeah. I'll win the next Showcase and get my second Princess Key.

9
00:00:26.766 --> 00:00:29.500
- Ne-ne-ne-ne-ne!
- Something wrong?

10
00:00:29.566 --> 00:00:32.200
I've gotta do so much more work on my routine.

11
00:00:32.266 --> 00:00:34.900
There's not much time and I have lots to do.

12
00:00:34.966 --> 00:00:38.200
All right. There's lots of stuff I need to do, too.

13
00:00:38.266 --> 00:00:41.933
- Buddy, how does some more training sound?
- Pikachu!

14
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.933
Hm.

15
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

16
00:00:45.866 --> 00:00:47.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

17
00:00:47.633 --> 00:00:51.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

18
00:00:51.066 --> 00:00:52.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

19
00:00:52.533 --> 00:00:56.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

20
00:00:56.366 --> 00:00:59.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

21
00:00:59.633 --> 00:01:03.066
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

22
00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:07.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

23
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:11.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

24
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

25
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:21.000
A Frolicking Find in the Flowers!

26
00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.733
- Wow.

27
00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.066
- Beautiful.
- Come on, Dedenne! Yippee, yay!

28
00:01:33.133 --> 00:01:35.800
Don't run so fast, you might get hurt!

29
00:01:35.866 --> 00:01:37.033
I won't.

30
00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:40.866
- Why don't we go have a look, too?
- Right!

31
00:01:40.933 --> 00:01:44.100
- Yay! Wheee!
- Denne!

32
00:01:44.166 --> 00:01:45.733
It smells so nice.

33
00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.066
- Don't you think, Dedenne?
- Denne-ne.

34
00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:52.566
- What a beautiful place.
- Yeah. The air is so fresh.

35
00:01:52.633 --> 00:01:55.066
Pika, pika.

36
00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:56.800
Vi, vi, Vivillon!

37
00:01:56.866 --> 00:01:59.933
- Look at those Vivillon.
- Vi, vi!

38
00:02:00.066 --> 00:02:01.700
Wow! And that Budew!

39
00:02:01.766 --> 00:02:04.033
- Hey, check out the Hoppip.
- Hoppip, Hoppip!

40
00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:07.000
This would be a great place to take a break.

41
00:02:07.066 --> 00:02:10.633
- Please, can we do it? Can we do it?
- Sure. Why not?

42
00:02:10.699 --> 00:02:12.866
In that case, I'll make us some tea.

43
00:02:12.933 --> 00:02:14.366
We're gonna play!

44
00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:17.333
Guys, let's go!

45
00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.033
- Lucha!
- Froga!

46
00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.966
- Talon!
- Noibat!

47
00:02:22.033 --> 00:02:23.566
And you, too!

48
00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:27.266
- Bunnelby!
- Luxray, ray.

49
00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:28.333
Chespin! Che!

50
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.833
Come on out!

51
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.266
- Braix, braix!
- Pancham, pan!

52
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:35.100
- Che, che, che.
- Ray?

53
00:02:35.166 --> 00:02:36.333
- Huh?
- Ray?

54
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.633
- Don't go too far, OK?
- Che, che, che. Che, che, che.

55
00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:42.533
Chespin! Pin, pin. Che, che, pin...

56
00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.533
Lazy twerps with nothing to do.

57
00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:49.666
True. Though I must say I'm a little bit envious of their carefree attitude.

58
00:02:49.733 --> 00:02:51.100
Yeah, me too.

59
00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:53.766
Sometimes a nap's just what the doctor ordered.

60
00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:56.266
Grr! Save your laziness for another day!

61
00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:02.133
That Showcase the twerpette's entering, I'm entering, too!

62
00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.033
But this time I'll win.

63
00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:07.366
Oh, yes, daintily dancing toward Kalos Queen!

64
00:03:07.433 --> 00:03:08.866
Ugh.

65
00:03:08.933 --> 00:03:10.866
I'd rather take a nap.

66
00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.233
Pika, pika!

67
00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.533
Pika, pika!

68
00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.566
- Lucha.
- Froga, Frogadier. Froga.

69
00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:23.033
Lucha. Hawlu!

70
00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.166
- Che! Pin, pin!
- Bunnelby!

71
00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:29.166
- Noibat! Noi.
- Talonflame.

72
00:03:29.233 --> 00:03:32.700
Brai, brai, brai. Braixen, Braixen!

73
00:03:32.766 --> 00:03:33.766
Braixen, brai.

74
00:03:33.833 --> 00:03:37.200
They're gorgeous. Thanks a lot, Braixen.

75
00:03:37.266 --> 00:03:40.666
Now just a second... It's perfect.

76
00:03:40.733 --> 00:03:43.233
- Brai!
- You're so good at that.

77
00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.666
- Thanks, I made one for you too.
- Sure.

78
00:03:45.733 --> 00:03:48.566
Huh? Oh!

79
00:03:48.633 --> 00:03:49.733
So pretty!

80
00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:52.566
- Denne, denne.
- This is yours.

81
00:03:52.633 --> 00:03:55.700
- Denne-ne.
- You're the cutest.

82
00:03:55.766 --> 00:03:57.133
Denne!

83
00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.766
- Cham, cham. Pan!
- Denne.

84
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:02.066
Cham!

85
00:04:02.133 --> 00:04:04.600
- Pancham, pan.
- Denne-ne.

86
00:04:04.666 --> 00:04:05.933
Pan.

87
00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.866
- You OK?
- Pancham, pan.

88
00:04:16.933 --> 00:04:19.600
It's an Eevee!

89
00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:25.100
Eevee. The Evolution Pokémon.

90
00:04:25.166 --> 00:04:29.200
Eevee is rarely seen, and can adapt to severe habitats by evolving,

91
00:04:29.266 --> 00:04:31.566
changing its capabilities and form.

92
00:04:31.633 --> 00:04:32.933
Eevee's so cute!

93
00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.633
Eevee obviously likes to dance. It's so light on its feet!

94
00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:38.133
- Serena!
- Huh?

95
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.533
- Clemont says the tea's ready!
- Ee!

96
00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:43.966
- Huh? Eevee, wait!
- Aww.

97
00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:47.566
It ran away. Aww.

98
00:04:47.633 --> 00:04:49.200
We're coming, Ash!

99
00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:52.200
Brai.

100
00:04:52.266 --> 00:04:54.700
You really saw a dancing Eevee?

101
00:04:54.766 --> 00:04:57.733
Yeah, and it moved so beautifully.

102
00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.900
Just like it was dancing on air.

103
00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:02.766
Wow, whaddaya know? Sorry I scared it.

104
00:05:02.833 --> 00:05:03.866
- Pika.
- It felt like,

105
00:05:03.933 --> 00:05:05.400
when I watched Eevee dancing,

106
00:05:05.466 --> 00:05:07.966
I might be able to come up with a brand-new routine.

107
00:05:08.033 --> 00:05:09.400
Pancham!

108
00:05:09.466 --> 00:05:12.333
So let's have it show you its dance moves again.

109
00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:13.900
- Pikachu!
- Huh?

110
00:05:13.966 --> 00:05:16.266
- Yeah. You should.
- Denne-ne!

111
00:05:16.333 --> 00:05:20.100
This time, you should try not to scare it away.

112
00:05:20.166 --> 00:05:22.600
- You're right about that.
- Cham, cham.

113
00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:25.433
- 'Kay. Eevee, here we come.
- Pika!

114
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.433
That Eevee's unbelievable.

115
00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:34.000
It's the ultimate Pokémon for an even more elegant performance.

116
00:05:34.066 --> 00:05:38.400
Hey, don't forget about me. I can cut a rug.

117
00:05:38.466 --> 00:05:40.400
♪ Put your right foot in ♪

118
00:05:40.466 --> 00:05:42.433
♪ And your left. Then do it again! ♪

119
00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:47.933
Wobb.

120
00:05:49.166 --> 00:05:51.333
Wonder where Eevee is.

121
00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:52.733
Pika, pika.

122
00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:56.333
I'm sure Eevee must live somewhere around here, but where?

123
00:05:58.333 --> 00:06:02.333
The future is now, thanks to science. Clemontic Gear, on!

124
00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:06.066
I thought that we'd encounter a situation precisely like this one.

125
00:06:06.133 --> 00:06:09.033
It's a robotic radar that detects living things.

126
00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:11.833
- My Living Thing Finder Mark Two.
- Mark Two?

127
00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.800
That's correct. I once used it to search for you.

128
00:06:14.866 --> 00:06:19.566
The living organism detection power used to be my invention's weakest point.

129
00:06:19.633 --> 00:06:23.566
But it's been improved. It can now detect any living thing.

130
00:06:23.633 --> 00:06:27.633
- Science is so amazing!
- OK. We're counting on you.

131
00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:30.633
Our target is very small.

132
00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:34.133
So let's narrow the search down to its size.

133
00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:36.366
Here we go.

134
00:06:38.066 --> 00:06:40.633
-Found it.

135
00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.200
- Whoa! That was quick!
- And it's over there.

136
00:06:44.266 --> 00:06:45.333
Vi, vi, vi.

137
00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:47.433
- But that's a Vivillon.
- Vi, vi, vi!

138
00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:50.066
Uh... One more time.

139
00:06:50.133 --> 00:06:53.000
Found it for sure! There!

140
00:06:53.066 --> 00:06:56.100
Eevee? Or not.

141
00:06:56.166 --> 00:06:58.766
- OK, back to the drawing board.
- Uh... Ha, ha...

142
00:06:58.833 --> 00:07:00.166
I don't understand.

143
00:07:12.066 --> 00:07:17.066
- Oh well, better luck next time.
- Thanks. I could use a little luck.

144
00:07:18.433 --> 00:07:20.633
Let's split up. That'll be better.

145
00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:23.333
You're right. So we'll head over that way.

146
00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.666
Braixen? And Pancham? You all set?

147
00:07:25.733 --> 00:07:27.333
- Braix.
- Pan.

148
00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:31.033
Hey, Noibat? Talonflame? Let me know if you see anything!

149
00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.500
- Talonflame.
- Noibat. Noi, noi.

150
00:07:33.566 --> 00:07:35.400
- Will you help, too?
- Ga.

151
00:07:35.466 --> 00:07:36.500
- Cha.
- Pika.

152
00:07:36.566 --> 00:07:40.000
- Clemont? What about you?
- All right.

153
00:07:40.066 --> 00:07:41.500
- Pin, pin, pin.
- Ray.

154
00:07:41.566 --> 00:07:42.566
Bunnelby!

155
00:07:42.633 --> 00:07:45.300
- Eevee?
- Pika, pika.

156
00:07:45.366 --> 00:07:47.100
Oddish.

157
00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:50.966
Talonflame.

158
00:07:51.033 --> 00:07:53.366
- Noibat?
- Skiploom.

159
00:07:53.433 --> 00:07:55.333
- Eevee, where are you?
- Bunnelby, by.

160
00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.466
Oddish. Oddish.

161
00:07:57.533 --> 00:07:59.800
Froga!

162
00:07:59.866 --> 00:08:03.366
- Have you seen Eevee?
- Burmy.

163
00:08:03.433 --> 00:08:06.666
Eevee! Where are you?

164
00:08:06.733 --> 00:08:09.633
- Cham!
- Huh? Braixen, any luck?

165
00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.600
Braixen.

166
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:14.133
I see. Wow. Maybe it isn't here.

167
00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.833
- Braixen? Let's try one more time.
- Braixen.

168
00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:21.133
- And you look over that way.
- Cham, cham, cham.

169
00:08:26.433 --> 00:08:28.233
Eevee!

170
00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.733
- Ee! Eevee! Ee!
- Huh?

171
00:08:32.799 --> 00:08:35.066
-Huh? Oh!

172
00:08:39.166 --> 00:08:41.400
Huh? Eevee!

173
00:08:41.466 --> 00:08:43.733
- Ee.
- Wow, you saved me.

174
00:08:43.799 --> 00:08:46.700
- Ee, Eevee, ee, ee. Eevee!
- Huh?

175
00:08:46.766 --> 00:08:48.700
Ee! Eevee!

176
00:08:51.866 --> 00:08:53.866
Huh? Aww.

177
00:08:53.933 --> 00:08:56.133
Huh?

178
00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.966
I'll leave this for Eevee.

179
00:08:59.933 --> 00:09:01.500
- Cham, cham!
- Huh?

180
00:09:01.566 --> 00:09:06.033
- Braixen?
- No. Not yet. Let's go.

181
00:09:17.233 --> 00:09:19.500
I wonder if this will really work.

182
00:09:19.566 --> 00:09:21.333
Serena makes yummy Poké Puffs.

183
00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.833
- I'm sure Eevee will love them!
- Che!

184
00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:27.966
- Back off, Chespin! That's not for you!
- Che! Chespin.

185
00:09:28.033 --> 00:09:30.000
- Luxray.
- Bunnel.

186
00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:36.833
By? Hm... Bunn.

187
00:09:41.133 --> 00:09:43.700
Chespin! Eh?

188
00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:47.933
Oh, no! The Poké Puff's gone!

189
00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.000
-Lux?

190
00:09:51.033 --> 00:09:54.500
- I knew it.
- Chespin, che.

191
00:09:54.566 --> 00:09:59.000
Che, Chespin, pin, che! Pin! Chespin, pin, pin, che!

192
00:09:59.466 --> 00:10:02.233
Who's that Pokémon?

193
00:10:06.066 --> 00:10:08.500
It's Eevee!

194
00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.000
Eevee!

195
00:10:13.366 --> 00:10:18.033
- You saw Eevee for real?
- Yeah. But sadly, it ran away.

196
00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:21.666
- Too bad.
- Let's look for it again tomorrow.

197
00:10:21.733 --> 00:10:23.366
Good idea!

198
00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:35.300
Ee?

199
00:10:35.366 --> 00:10:37.266
Ee!

200
00:10:38.633 --> 00:10:41.066
Vee, vee, ee!

201
00:10:45.233 --> 00:10:47.666
Pan, cham-cham-cham-cham...

202
00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.166
- Brai...
- Pan, cham-cham-cham-cham...

203
00:10:54.066 --> 00:10:58.700
-Pan, pan, pan. Cham-cham-cham-cham...

204
00:10:58.766 --> 00:11:01.500
- Brai?
- Shh!

205
00:11:06.066 --> 00:11:08.000
Cham! Pancham.

206
00:11:09.533 --> 00:11:11.133
Cham, cham.

207
00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.000
I didn't mean to wake you up.

208
00:11:13.066 --> 00:11:17.600
I couldn't sleep, that's all. I'm going to take a walk.

209
00:11:25.566 --> 00:11:27.000
Oh!

210
00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.700
- Braixen.
- Pancham.

211
00:11:43.766 --> 00:11:48.033
Look what it's wearing! Eevee likes it!

212
00:11:52.166 --> 00:11:56.166
Wow, I'd really like to become great friends with that Eevee.

213
00:11:56.233 --> 00:11:59.233
Do you two think it would be a good idea if I did?

214
00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:01.633
- Braixen, braix!
- Pancham, Pancham.

215
00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.833
Thanks! I will!

216
00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:05.233
But how in the world

217
00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:09.000
am I ever going to let Eevee know that I want to be friends?

218
00:12:19.966 --> 00:12:22.566
Now, let's find Eevee today for sure!

219
00:12:22.633 --> 00:12:24.033
You know what?

220
00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:27.466
I don't think I want to look for Eevee the same way today.

221
00:12:27.533 --> 00:12:29.433
- Huh?
- Pika?

222
00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.700
Huh? You're not giving up, are you?

223
00:12:31.766 --> 00:12:34.466
No way. I've got a better idea.

224
00:12:37.966 --> 00:12:39.766
What are you gonna do?

225
00:12:39.833 --> 00:12:43.800
I figure it would be better if we show Eevee our performance instead.

226
00:12:43.866 --> 00:12:47.800
- Really? Your performance?
- Right. It makes sense.

227
00:12:47.866 --> 00:12:51.033
We were drawn to how happy Eevee looked while dancing.

228
00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:52.733
So I think it would be a great idea

229
00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:55.300
to show Eevee how happy we are by dancing, too.

230
00:12:55.366 --> 00:12:57.033
Great! I like it.

231
00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:59.200
After all, your performances are really good.

232
00:12:59.266 --> 00:13:00.366
- Mm-hm.
- Pika!

233
00:13:00.433 --> 00:13:04.633
Bonnie, that is so sweet. So, what do you two say?

234
00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:06.600
- Are we on?
- Braixen.

235
00:13:06.666 --> 00:13:08.400
Cham, cham!

236
00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:13.833
- Braixen, Flamethrower!
- Braixen!

237
00:13:16.966 --> 00:13:18.666
Vee?

238
00:13:20.066 --> 00:13:21.400
Eevee?

239
00:13:23.466 --> 00:13:27.133
- OK, Pancham, Dark Pulse, go!
- Cham!

240
00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.400
Cham!

241
00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.800
- Cham!
- ♪ Ta-da! ♪

242
00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:43.566
Cham, cham.

243
00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:46.000
- Amazing!
- It sure was.

244
00:13:46.066 --> 00:13:49.100
Pika!

245
00:13:49.166 --> 00:13:50.733
Huh?

246
00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:52.633
So, did you like what we did?

247
00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.633
- Not too bad, right?
- Huh?

248
00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.533
Vee! Vee!

249
00:14:00.266 --> 00:14:03.833
- It's Eevee!
- Eevee was this close the whole time?

250
00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.966
How cool is that? It worked.

251
00:14:06.033 --> 00:14:08.066
Eevee came, just like you thought it would.

252
00:14:08.133 --> 00:14:09.133
Mm-hm.

253
00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:13.533
See, Eevee, the three of us really like to perform together as a team.

254
00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:17.066
We compete with other performers in the Pokémon Showcase,

255
00:14:17.133 --> 00:14:19.266
- and it's a whole lot of fun.
- Braixen.

256
00:14:19.333 --> 00:14:20.366
Pan, Pancham.

257
00:14:20.433 --> 00:14:23.533
Do you think maybe you'd like to perform with us

258
00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:25.600
on stage in the Pokémon Showcase?

259
00:14:25.666 --> 00:14:27.966
That's a great idea!

260
00:14:28.033 --> 00:14:30.466
Then Eevee would get to be part of your team.

261
00:14:30.533 --> 00:14:32.733
- Mm-hm.
- Eevee?

262
00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:35.600
Because it's so much fun to watch you dance.

263
00:14:35.666 --> 00:14:38.100
I want lots more people to see you, too.

264
00:14:39.366 --> 00:14:42.866
What do you say? Would you like to be part of our group?

265
00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:49.866
Ah! Eevee!

266
00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.500
- Eevee!
- Ee!

267
00:14:51.566 --> 00:14:53.300
- Eevee!
- Hey, what's going on?

268
00:14:53.366 --> 00:14:55.966
Prepare for trouble, it's surely not you!

269
00:14:56.033 --> 00:14:58.400
And make it double, we love what we do!

270
00:14:58.466 --> 00:15:00.800
To protect the world from devastation!

271
00:15:00.866 --> 00:15:03.600
To unite all people within our nation!

272
00:15:03.666 --> 00:15:06.533
To ruin your performance at every turn!

273
00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:10.033
To extend our reach with power to burn!

274
00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:11.866
- Jessie!
- And James.

275
00:15:11.933 --> 00:15:15.333
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

276
00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:18.433
Surrender now or prepare for a choreographed fight!

277
00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.766
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

278
00:15:23.166 --> 00:15:25.800
- Team Rocket! Not you guys again.
- Eevee! Eevee!

279
00:15:25.866 --> 00:15:27.033
- Ee! Ee!
- Pikachu!

280
00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:29.766
- You let Eevee go!
- What for?

281
00:15:29.833 --> 00:15:33.033
I'm the one travelling down the road to stardom with Eevee!

282
00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:35.533
- What do you mean?
- Bonnie, no!

283
00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:38.133
You heard him. Gourgeist, go!

284
00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:40.633
Gour!

285
00:15:41.533 --> 00:15:43.700
Inkay, join the fray!

286
00:15:45.633 --> 00:15:46.700
Kay!

287
00:15:46.833 --> 00:15:50.433
- Inkay! Use Psybeam!
- Inkay!

288
00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:52.700
Pikachu, Electro Ball! Go!

289
00:15:52.766 --> 00:15:56.233
Pika! Pika, pika, pi!

290
00:15:57.633 --> 00:16:01.033
All right, Braixen and Pancham, help Eevee!

291
00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:02.266
- Brai! Braixen!
- Pancham!

292
00:16:02.333 --> 00:16:03.533
Ee!

293
00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:07.166
She's such an irritating twerpette. Shadow Ball!

294
00:16:07.233 --> 00:16:08.233
Gourgeist!

295
00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:12.433
- Braixen, Flamethrower!
- Brai, Braixen!

296
00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:17.533
- OK, Inkay, use Tackle!
- Ink!

297
00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:21.700
Quick, Pikachu, Iron Tail! -Pikachu!

298
00:16:21.766 --> 00:16:22.933
Pika!

299
00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.966
Use Foul Play!

300
00:16:25.033 --> 00:16:26.766
- Pika!
- Ink!

301
00:16:26.833 --> 00:16:28.966
- Pika!
- No, Pikachu!

302
00:16:29.033 --> 00:16:31.200
Now, Pancham, use Stone Edge!

303
00:16:31.266 --> 00:16:34.466
Cham, cham!

304
00:16:37.266 --> 00:16:39.200
- Vee!
- Eevee!

305
00:16:39.266 --> 00:16:43.000
You keep that twerpette away from Eevee!

306
00:16:43.066 --> 00:16:44.700
Seed Bomb, now!

307
00:16:44.766 --> 00:16:47.000
Go-go-go-go-go-go!

308
00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.400
- Eevee!
- Ee!

309
00:16:51.466 --> 00:16:52.500
Aah!

310
00:16:52.566 --> 00:16:56.000
- Serena!
- Aah! Are you OK?

311
00:16:56.833 --> 00:16:57.900
- Ee, ee, Eevee! Eevee!
- Ah!

312
00:16:58.833 --> 00:17:01.466
- No you don't!
- Dance your way back here!

313
00:17:01.533 --> 00:17:04.166
- You're wasting your fancy footwork!
- Ee!

314
00:17:04.233 --> 00:17:06.400
That's far enough!

315
00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:11.066
- Vee?
- Oh, please. Gourgeist, Seed Bomb!

316
00:17:11.133 --> 00:17:13.133
Go-go-go-go-go-geist!

317
00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:15.333
- Aah!
- Serena!

318
00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.833
Aaaaah! Huh?

319
00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:20.833
- Ee...
- Eevee did that?

320
00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:23.599
- It just used Protect.
- To help Serena!

321
00:17:23.666 --> 00:17:26.099
- Braixen, brai.
- Cham, cham.

322
00:17:26.166 --> 00:17:28.600
Eevee!

323
00:17:30.666 --> 00:17:32.733
Pikachu! Use Thunderbolt!

324
00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:36.266
Pikachu!

325
00:17:37.833 --> 00:17:40.133
Eevee was my path to stardom!

326
00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:42.166
Check out this fancy footwork!

327
00:17:42.233 --> 00:17:44.900
Actually, air travel doesn't use feet.

328
00:17:44.966 --> 00:17:46.533
- We're...
- blasting...

329
00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.666
- .off again!
- Inkay!

330
00:17:48.733 --> 00:17:50.200
Wobbuffet!

331
00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:55.000
- Can't you take a hint?
- Eevee, thanks so much.

332
00:17:55.966 --> 00:17:58.000
Ee! Vee!

333
00:17:58.066 --> 00:18:01.066
So as I was saying, please, Eevee.

334
00:18:01.133 --> 00:18:03.266
Won't you travel along with us?

335
00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:06.100
If we all dance together, it'll be more fun.

336
00:18:06.166 --> 00:18:08.066
- Braixen.
- Pancham, Pancham.

337
00:18:09.966 --> 00:18:12.600
Eevee...

338
00:18:18.766 --> 00:18:19.933
Ee, ee!

339
00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.366
- So that means you'll come with us?
- Pika?

340
00:18:22.433 --> 00:18:24.233
- Eevee!
- Welcome aboard!

341
00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:27.033
-Pika!

342
00:18:29.633 --> 00:18:31.433
Ready?

343
00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.333
-Ee!

344
00:18:40.366 --> 00:18:43.200
♪ Ta-da! ♪ Aah!

345
00:18:43.266 --> 00:18:46.400
A new chapter in my life. Because I caught an Eevee!

346
00:18:46.466 --> 00:18:48.366
- Cham, Pancham!
- Braix!

347
00:18:48.433 --> 00:18:51.000
- Yeah, good for you!
- Pikachu!

348
00:18:51.066 --> 00:18:53.000
- You did it!
- Congratulations!

349
00:18:53.066 --> 00:18:56.800
Thanks, you guys. So come back out and say hi!

350
00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:01.400
- Eevee!
- Braixen, brai!

351
00:19:01.466 --> 00:19:02.600
Pancham, Pancham!

352
00:19:02.666 --> 00:19:05.366
- 'Kay gang, let's go!
- You, too!

353
00:19:07.866 --> 00:19:10.000
- Froga.
- Talonflame!

354
00:19:10.866 --> 00:19:12.766
- Noibat.
- Hawlucha, lucha!

355
00:19:13.666 --> 00:19:15.333
- Luxray, ray.
- Bunnelby.

356
00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:16.600
Chespin, che!

357
00:19:16.666 --> 00:19:19.333
- It's nice to meet you.
- Pika, pika.

358
00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:23.733
- Ee, ee, ee, ee, ee!
- Cham?

359
00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:26.966
I'd say when Eevee gets in front of others,

360
00:19:27.033 --> 00:19:29.466
it feels just a little bit shy.

361
00:19:29.533 --> 00:19:31.366
Now, don't you worry, Eevee.

362
00:19:31.433 --> 00:19:34.766
Everyone's real nice. So, let's be friends.

363
00:19:34.833 --> 00:19:36.466
- Huh.
- Denne-ne.

364
00:19:36.533 --> 00:19:38.300
- Eevee!
- Uh-oh...

365
00:19:38.366 --> 00:19:40.800
Ee, vee, vee, vee, vee, vee.

366
00:19:40.866 --> 00:19:43.000
- Ha-cha, ha.
- Vee!

367
00:19:43.066 --> 00:19:44.533
- Cha? Lu?
- Frogadier.

368
00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:47.000
- Vee, vee.
- Pin, pin. Che, Chespin. Che.

369
00:19:47.066 --> 00:19:48.600
- Vee!
- Pin?

370
00:19:48.666 --> 00:19:53.000
- Bunn? Bunnelby? Bunnelby, by.
- Che!

371
00:19:53.066 --> 00:19:54.433
Bunn, Bunnelby, by.

372
00:19:54.566 --> 00:19:57.566
Oh, well, what do you know? It's comfortable with Bunnelby.

373
00:19:57.633 --> 00:20:00.433
- That's because Bunnelby's nice.
- Chespin, Chespin!

374
00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:02.333
- Che! Chespin, che!
- Vee, vee, vee!

375
00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:04.933
- Che, Chespin! Chespin!
- Eevee! Ee! Eevee!

376
00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.433
- Huh?
- Hey! Cut it out!

377
00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:09.333
Hey, Serena, I'm really glad you made a new friend.

378
00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:11.033
- Thanks!
- Pika, pika.

379
00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.933
- Me, too. Braixen and Pancham.
- Chespin!

380
00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.533
And now Eevee!

381
00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:18.766
We will win the Pokémon Showcase together.

382
00:20:18.833 --> 00:20:21.500
I'm gonna train hard, too!

383
00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.366
- Eevee!
- Hm!

384
00:20:28.766 --> 00:20:31.933
- I'm so happy you're here.
- Eevee!

385
00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:35.966
There's no doubt that things are going to get even livelier

386
00:20:36.033 --> 00:20:38.466
with Serena's new friend Eevee in the group.

387
00:20:38.533 --> 00:20:42.566
So now, our heroes are off once again to Anistar City,

388
00:20:42.633 --> 00:20:44.566
as the journey continues!
